				<description>&lt;p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;      &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;        &#xA;      &#xA;    &#xA;      &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;        &#xA;      &#xA;    &#xA;      &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;          &#xA;        &#xA;      &#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;picture&gt;&#xA;      &lt;source&#xA;        type=&#34;image/webp&#34;&#xA;        srcset=&#34;https://jadi.space/blog/i-do-not-have-a-roadmap-for-you-i-have-something-better/img-01_hu_d6bc6b01c02e82d5.webp 300w,/blog/i-do-not-have-a-roadmap-for-you-i-have-something-better/img-01_hu_dfa09af3f2e9e66e.webp 500w,/blog/i-do-not-have-a-roadmap-for-you-i-have-something-better/img-01_hu_379e421b1db08a8f.webp 700w&#34;&#xA;        sizes=&#34;(max-width: 499px) 300px,(max-width: 699px) 500px,700px&#34;&#xA;      /&gt;&#xA;      &lt;img&#xA;        src=&#34;https://jadi.space/blog/i-do-not-have-a-roadmap-for-you-i-have-something-better/img-01.png&#34;&#xA;        srcset=&#34;https://jadi.space/blog/i-do-not-have-a-roadmap-for-you-i-have-something-better/img-01_hu_5b71cc9192605a9f.png 300w,/blog/i-do-not-have-a-roadmap-for-you-i-have-something-better/img-01_hu_739db5fbe08d892f.png 500w,/blog/i-do-not-have-a-roadmap-for-you-i-have-something-better/img-01_hu_73ccb5434036ce8.png 700w&#34;&#xA;        sizes=&#34;(max-width: 499px) 300px,(max-width: 699px) 500px,700px&#34;&#xA;        alt=&#34;I do not have a roadmap for you; I have something better&#34;&#xA;        &#xA;        loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;        width=&#34;1200&#34;&#xA;        height=&#34;800&#34;&#xA;      /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/picture&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I do not understand roadmaps in computer science. They are cool and fun to look at, but they are HUGE, FRIGHTENING, and they need dedication; I mean long-term… year-long-term dedication.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Instead, I love bite-sized fun things to do. I have 3 hours in my hand this evening. I’m not going to spend it on page 120–128 of that textbook. My style is downloading Grafana and installing it on my computer and checking how it works. Or logging into GitHub, creating an action, and trying to do something with it, or logging into Azure and creating a VM and seeing if I can expand its disk space (is this even a thing? Have to try after posting this and before heading to the pool).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
